* Auto-generated testbench for voltage divider: R5/R6
* Expected Vout = 3.3 * 0.312500 = 1.0312 V
* Model: ideal passives (exact, unloaded)

VIN MOTOR_MINUS 0 DC 3.3
R5 MOTOR_MINUS MID_SENSE 22k
R6 MID_SENSE 0 10k

.control
op 
let vout_sim = v(MID_SENSE)
let error_pct = abs(vout_sim - 1.03125) / 1.03125 * 100
echo "vout_sim=$&vout_sim error_pct=$&error_pct expected=1.03125" > voltage-divider_R5_R6.out
quit
.endc

.end
